      "id": "claim_3d74fbdf8de04f4d83bad7c72e63eee6",
      "statement": "Regime-selection turnover is addressed by regime tagging plus the regime-conditional gamma multiplier, which is the sizing mechanism that prevents a single-regime strategy from being sized as if its favourable regime will persist.",
